","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்னர்","parts":[{"text":"நன்னர்","lemma":"நன்னர்","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெஞ்ச","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்ச","lemma":"நெஞ்ச","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெகிழ்த்த","parts":[{"text":"நெகிழ்த்த","lemma":"நெகிழ்த்த","gloss":"having softened"}],"gloss":"having softened","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பின்றை","parts":[{"text":"பின்றை","lemma":"பின்றை","gloss":"afterwards"}],"gloss":"afterwards","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரைமுதிர்","parts":[{"text":"வரைமுதிர்","lemma":"வரைமுதிர்","gloss":"mountain-matured"}],"gloss":"mountain-matured","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தேனிற்","parts":[{"text":"தேனிற்","lemma":"தேனிற்","gloss":"like honey"}],"gloss":"like honey","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"போகியோனே","parts":[{"text":"போகியோனே","lemma":"போகியோனே","gloss":"he went away indeed"}],"gloss":"he went away indeed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆசா","parts":[{"text":"ஆசா","lemma":"ஆசா","gloss":"support"}],"gloss":"support","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கெந்தை","parts":[{"text":"கெந்தை","lemma":"கெந்தை","gloss":"becoming my lord"}],"gloss":"becoming my lord","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யாண்டுளன்","parts":[{"text":"யாண்டுளன்","lemma":"யாண்டுளன்","gloss":"where is he"}],"gloss":"where is he","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்லோ","lemma":"கொல்லோ","gloss":"I wonder"}],"gloss":"I wonder","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேறுபுல","parts":[{"text":"வேறுபுல","lemma":"வேறுபுல","gloss":"other land"}],"gloss":"other land","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னன்னாட்டுப்","parts":[{"text":"னன்னாட்டுப்","lemma":"னன்னாட்டுப்","gloss":"in the good country"}],"gloss":"in the good country","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெய்த","parts":[{"text":"பெய்த","lemma":"பெய்த","gloss":"rained"}],"gloss":"rained","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏறுடை","parts":[{"text":"ஏறுடை","lemma":"ஏறுடை","gloss":"having thunder"}],"gloss":"having thunder","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மழையிற்","parts":[{"text":"மழையிற்","lemma":"மழையிற்","gloss":"like the rain"}],"gloss":"like the rain","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கலிழும்என்","parts":[{"text":"கலிழும்என்","lemma":"கலிழும்என்","gloss":"roars, my"}],"gloss":"roars, my","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னெஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"னெஞ்சே","lemma":"னெஞ்சே","gloss":"heart indeed"}],"gloss":"heart indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"One day he did not come, two days he did not come / for many days having come, humble words having practiced, my / good heart having softened, afterwards / like honey matured on the mountain, he went away / my support, my lord, where is he, I wonder? / in another region's good country rained / like the thunder-possessing rain, roars my heart.","translation":"He did not come for just one day, nor did he come for just two days. Having come for many days and spoken gentle, humble words, he softened my good heart. But after that, he vanished like honey matured on a high mountain. Where is my lord, who was my sole support? My heart now roars and grieves, like thunderous rain pouring down on a good land in some far-off country.","modern":"அவன் ஒரு நாள் வரவில்லை, இரண்டு நாட்களும் வரவில்லை. பல நாட்கள் வந்து, பணிவான மொழிகளைப் பேசி, என் நல்ல நெஞ்சத்தை நெகிழச் செய்த பிறகு, மலை மேல் முதிர்ந்த தேனைப் போல அவன் மறைந்து போனான். எனக்குப் பற்றுகோடாக விளங்கிய என் தலைவன் இப்போது எங்கே இருக்கிறானோ? வேறு ஒரு நல்ல நாட்டில் பெய்கின்ற இடியுடன் கூடிய மழையைப் போல என் நெஞ்சம் கதறி அழுகின்றது.","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) speaks in distress about the hero's sudden absence after winning the heroine's heart. The hero courted the heroine for many days with sweet, humble words until her heart melted. But once he gained her love, he disappeared, leaving her like a mountain from which the precious, long-matured honey has been taken away. This poem belongs to the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape, where the image of 'honey matured on the mountain' (வரைமுதிர் தேன்) represents the rare and precious love that took a long time to cultivate. The heroine's roaring, grieving heart is compared to thunderous rain falling in a distant land, signifying her helpless, echoing grief.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.4],[1.4,1.9],[1.9,2.6],[2.6,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.8],[3.8,4.8],[4.8,5.1],[5.1,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,6.94],[6.94,7.05],[7.05,7.5],[7.5,7.5],[7.5,7.92],[7.92,7.92],[7.92,9.6],[9.6,9.6],[9.6,9.6],[9.6,9.6],[9.6,11.9],[11.9,12.8],[12.8,13.4],[13.4,14.0],[14.05,14.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.7],[1.7,2.2],[2.2,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.5,4.6],[4.6,5.7],[5.7,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,6.6],[6.6,7.6],[7.6,8.3],[8.3,8.6],[8.6,8.9],[8.9,8.9],[8.9,8.9],[8.9,8.9],[8.9,8.9],[8.9,12.3],[12.37,12.96],[12.96,13.2],[13.35,13.65],[13.65,14.7],[14.7,15.5],[15.55,15.8]]}}